There is an innate difference in how Naturalist works mechanically. If you are allowed to activate form icons, you may do so. In that case, the ordering of those icons on his one-shots is <em>irrelevant</em>. If you are in the form, you can activate the effect while that one-shot is still in play resolving.&nbsp;

[/quote]

Wasn&#39;t there talk (between Fixed Point shenanigans and symbol effects that allow The Naturalist to use Transform mid one-shot) about him having to go from top to bottom with his activation effects?&nbsp; For instance if he had a card with [R] [G] [C] (no idea if he has that or not) from top to bottom and he was a Rhinocedile he would have to activate the [R] effect before the [C] effect?<br /><br />EDIT: Or phantaskippy said it first.
